  realmDialogue:
  - Very well. I will learn, my lord. Perhaps I will see you in another life.
  - I promise to you... I will do better in my next life.
  - I appreciate you more than you could know, my lord. I will never forget you throughout my lives.
  thingsPersonSays:
  - key: "Hello. My name is Lady Yanagiya. Please treat me kindly... I\u2019ve gone through so much. "
    value:
    - "\u201CLady\u201D? Are you of noble blood?"
    - What has transpired that you believe warrants my compassion?
  - key: "Yes, my lord. My father is a wealthy aristocrat. Though that is not important here\u2026"
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: "It\u2019s quite the tale, my lord... I was at Kiyomizu. I had gone to pray to Kannon. When a handsome man approached me."
    value:
    - Why had you gone to pray?
    - Who was the man?
  - key: None3
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None4
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: " Well\u2026 While I am of beautiful visage, my luck romantically had been stale. I went to pray for love."
    value:
    - "If you\u2019re so beautiful, why the lack of suitors?"
    - 
  - key: "At first glance, he simply looked like\u2026 A handsome aristocrat. He said\u2026 Oh, I was a fool\u2026"
    value:
    - What did he say?
    - 
  - key: None7
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None8
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None9
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None10
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: "Are you trying to say I\u2019m ugly? My advisor tells me I\u2019m beautiful all the time. That\u2019s all that matters, anyway."
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: None12
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: " He was a bold man. He said he was unmarried... Complimented me\u2026 And asked for my hand in marriage. Of course, I obliged. I had gone to pray for someone like him, after all!"
    value:
    - Why did you say you were a fool?
    - Did you know him?
