  - key: "Well, during the wedding ceremony\u2026 I kept noticing strange occurrences around the venue. Tiger-like dogs lurching from corners, mice cooking the very food we were eating\u2026 It was all very impure! That\u2019s when I knew all wasn\u2019t as it seemed."
    value:
    - 
    - 
  - key: "Not at first. But when I realized the truth of his home, it was like I could see with a fresh pair of eyes. He was no man\u2026 He was a mouse! Without sparing a second, I used one of the strings from my koto to spring a trap on him. I saw him start to gnaw through it, but I had turned my back and started to run before I saw much more. And now\u2026 I\u2019m here."
    value:
    - 
    - 
  endingDialogue:
  - "Well, my lord, you\u2019ve heard my story. I hope you sympathize with me. I truly believe I am deserving of the pure land\u2014"
  - "I followed the scripture as well as I could! I just can\u2019t believe I fell for that hideous mouse\u2019s trap\u2026"
  - Please be merciful, Jizo Bodhisattva!
